        <children>
          <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-h2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Coverage dimensions and operating data</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-p2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-p2s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Technical data: </text>
        </children>
        <children>
          <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-p2s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>pattern дясна ъглова ивица; coverage 1.5 × 4.6 m; operating pressure 2.1–3.8 bar, recommended 3.1 bar. Flow is 0.68–1.06 L/min, depending on system pressure.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-h3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-h3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Adjusting the spray pattern</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-p3</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-p3s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Adjustment: </text>
