        <children>
          <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-p3s1</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>coverage size and boundaries are adjusted while the system is running. The multi-stream rotary pattern produces larger droplets, and tool-free adjustment helps match the spray to the strip outline.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-h4</_key>
