          <_key>42f54182-8fc4-41ee-9b8c-2c50b504907d-en-p4s0</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>LCS creates a left-corner strip, RCS a right-corner strip, and SST a long side strip. Select the pattern according to the sprinkler position; left- and right-corner models are not interchangeable.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
